wiz_swap.description:
{intro}

1. **Unplug the old coordinator** and put it away. It must never be plugged in on this network again.
2. **Plug in the new coordinator.** {plug_in}

{current_line}

wiz_swap_migrate.description:
{intro}

1. **Unplug the old coordinator** and keep it somewhere safe: it still holds your network if you need to go back. Don't plug it in while the new one runs.
2. **Plug in the new coordinator.** {plug_in}

{current_line}

wiz_confirm.description:
