**New coordinator:** {target}

{start_note}

**Good to know**
{warnings}

Press **Next** to restore.

wiz_blocked.description:
Radio Guard won't restore {file}:
{reasons}

Nothing was changed. Press **Submit** to choose another backup.

wiz_done_next.description:
{source} is running on the new stick (`{port}`) with your network {network}, and Radio Guard took a fresh backup of it.

{devices}

