ha_backups.description:
Radio Guard keeps your coordinator backups in `/config/{dir}`, so they travel inside Home Assistant's own backups: the ones you restore from if this machine dies. Right now:

{problems}

Open **Settings > System > Backups** to change Home Assistant's backup settings. This message clears itself once they're fixed.
